T*
(AIA Pro Achiever Invest is a regular premium investment-linked plan \(ILP\) that combines life) Tj
T*
(protection, critical illness coverage, and investment in a choice of sub-funds. Part of each) Tj
T*
(premium pays for insurance charges and part is invested according to the Policy Owner's) Tj
T*
(chosen fund allocation.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(WHO IS IT FOR) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This plan suits individuals aged 18 to 55 who want to build long-term wealth while) Tj
T*
(maintaining life and critical illness protection in a single plan, and who are comfortable) Tj
T*
(with investment risk, including the possibility that fund value may fall below total) Tj
T*
(premiums paid.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(KEY BENEFITS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Death Benefit: the higher of the sum assured or the account value is paid on death. Critical) Tj
T*
(Illness Benefit: 100% of the critical illness sum assured is paid on first diagnosis of one) Tj
T*
(of 105 covered critical illnesses, and the plan continues for the remaining death benefit.) Tj
T*
(Investment Choice: access to over 60 sub-funds across equity, bond, and multi-asset) Tj
T*
(strategies, with free fund switches up to 12 times a year.) Tj
